<div class="tab-panel" id="panel-triage">
<div class="page-hdr">
<div class="page-tag">⚡ Section 2</div>
<div class="page-title">TDX Ticket Process</div>
<div class="page-desc">Visual sequence for handling incoming tickets from initial review through final closure.</div>
</div>
<div class="step-row">
<div class="step-item">
<div class="step-num">1</div>
<div class="step-label">Step 1</div>
<div class="step-text">Access TDX &amp; Open Ticket</div>
</div>
<div class="step-item">
<div class="step-num">2</div>
<div class="step-label">Step 2</div>
<div class="step-text">Set Open &amp; Send Analyst Template</div>
</div>
<div class="step-item">
<div class="step-num">3</div>
<div class="step-label">Step 3</div>
<div class="step-text">Request Intake &amp; Security Docs</div>
</div>
<div class="step-item">
<div class="step-num">4</div>
<div class="step-label">Step 4</div>
<div class="step-text">Update Status &amp; Start Time Clock</div>
</div>
<div class="step-item">
<div class="step-num">5</div>
<div class="step-label">Step 5</div>
<div class="step-text">2-Week Lifecycle / Approval Review</div>
</div>
<div class="step-item">
<div class="step-num">6</div>
<div class="step-label">Step 6</div>
<div class="step-text">Execute Approval / Rejection &amp; Log Time</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="grid-2">
<div class="card">
<div class="card-title"><span class="ico">1️⃣</span> Step 1 — Access TDX &amp; Open Ticket</div>
<ul class="styled">
<li>Log in to TDX with your UT credentials</li>
<li>Navigate to the <strong>"Open ALL GRC Tickets"</strong> dashboard report</li>
<li>Identify tickets with <span class="inline-code">STATUS = New</span> or <span class="inline-code">PRIM RESP = Blank</span></li>
<li>Click Ticket ID to open and review form fields</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="card-title"><span class="ico">2️⃣</span> Step 2 — Set Open &amp; Send Analyst Template</div>
<ul class="styled">
<li>Assign yourself as Primary Responsible</li>
<li>Change ticket status to <span class="inline-code">Open</span></li>
<li>Apply template: <span class="inline-code">GRC &gt; Analyst Assigned</span></li>
<li>This stops the <strong>Respond By SLA</strong> clock</li>
<li>Start your Time Tracking — Time Started</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="card-title"><span class="ico">3️⃣</span> Step 3 — Request Intake &amp; Security Docs</div>
<ul class="styled">
<li>Review all form fields for completeness</li>
<li>If missing intake data → apply <span class="inline-code">GRC &gt; New Tech Intake</span> template</li>
<li>Request security docs: SOC 2, ISO 27001, HITRUST, or HECVAT</li>
<li>Set status to <span class="inline-code">Awaiting Response</span> and pause time</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="card-title"><span class="ico">4️⃣</span> Step 4 — Update Status &amp; Start Time Clock</div>
<ul class="styled">
<li>Once requester responds → set status to <span class="inline-code">In Progress</span></li>
<li>Resume time tracking — Time Running</li>
<li>Begin UpGuard vendor lookup and evidence review</li>
<li>Classify data types and deployment model</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="card-title"><span class="ico">5️⃣</span> Step 5 — 2-Week Lifecycle / Approval Review</div>
<ul class="styled">
<li><strong>Resolve By SLA</strong> = 14 calendar days from ticket creation</li>
<li>Conduct full UpGuard risk assessment</li>
<li>Review all evidence for freshness (&lt; 3 years)</li>
<li>If score &gt; 600 → proceed to approval</li>
<li>If score &lt; 600 → treat/adjust risks and document</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="card-title"><span class="ico">6️⃣</span> Step 6 — Execute Approval / Rejection &amp; Log Time</div>
<ul class="styled">
<li>Click <strong>Approve Ticket</strong> or <strong>Reject Ticket</strong> in Current Activities panel</li>
<li><strong>NEVER</strong> set Status = Resolved manually</li>
<li>Log all time entries — zero exceptions</li>
<li>Document final findings in the TDX feed</li>
<li>Time Tracking → Stopped</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- ============================================================ STATUS & SLA -->
<div class="tab-panel" id="panel-status">
<div class="page-hdr">
<div class="page-tag">📊 Section 3</div>
<div class="page-title">Status, Time-Tracking &amp; SLA Matrix</div>
<div class="page-desc">Every ticket status change dictates a corresponding time-tracking state. Status changes must be recorded immediately.</div>
</div>
<div class="card" style="margin-bottom:16px;">
<div class="card-title"><span class="ico">📊</span> Ticket Status &amp; Time Tracking Matrix</div>
<table class="tbl">
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Ticket Status</th>
<th>Operational Definition &amp; Workflow Condition</th>
<th>Time Tracking</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><span class="badge badge-blue">New</span></td>
<td>Ticket is unassigned in the queue; Respond By SLA clock is actively ticking.</td>
<td><span class="badge badge-amber">Time Started</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><span class="badge badge-orange">Open</span></td>
<td>Assigned to an analyst; initial triage complete, work preparation underway.</td>
<td><span class="badge badge-orange">Time Running</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><span class="badge badge-amber">In Progress</span></td>
<td>Requester responded; analyst is actively conducting risk analysis or review.</td>
<td><span class="badge badge-orange">Time Running</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><span class="badge badge-grey">Awaiting Response</span></td>
<td>Waiting on requester or vendor to provide required security documentation.</td>
<td><span class="badge badge-grey">Time Paused</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><span class="badge badge-grey">On Hold</span></td>
<td>Paused for authorization, committee review, or set scheduled future date.</td>
<td><span class="badge badge-grey">Time Paused</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><span class="badge badge-blue">Solution Proposed</span></td>
<td>Alternative proposal or risk mitigation option presented to requester.</td>
<td><span class="badge badge-grey">Time Paused</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><span class="badge badge-green">Resolved</span></td>
<td>Risk assessment completed and approved/rejected via Current Activities.</td>
<td><span class="badge badge-green">Time Stopped</span></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div class="grid-2">
<div class="card">
<div class="card-title"><span class="ico">⏱</span> SLA Standards</div>
<ul class="styled">
<li><strong>Respond By SLA:</strong> Stopped when an analyst assigns responsibility and sends the <em>Analyst Assigned</em> template to the requester.</li>
<li><strong>Resolve By SLA:</strong> Auto-configured for exactly <strong>14 calendar days (2 weeks)</strong> from initial ticket arrival.</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="card-title"><span class="ico">📑</span> Template Quick Reference</div>
<table class="tbl">
<thead><tr><th>Template</th><th>When to Apply</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td><span class="inline-code">GRC &gt; Analyst Assigned</span></td><td>Upon taking responsibility — stops Respond By SLA</td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="inline-code">GRC &gt; New Tech Intake</span></td><td>Ticket missing required intake form data</td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="inline-code">GRC &gt; Potential Approval - Security Docs</span></td><td>Request SOC 2, ISO 27001, HITRUST, or HECVAT</td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="inline-code">GRC &gt; Potential Approval - PCI Docs</span></td><td>Credit card or payment processing functionality</td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="inline-code">GRC &gt; Stalled Ticket</span></td><td>At 2-week mark with no requester response</td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="inline-code">GRC &gt; Ticket Closure</span></td><td>Closing due to missing docs or cancelled project</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- ============================================================ COMMUNICATION -->
<div class="tab-panel" id="panel-comms">
<div class="page-hdr">
<div class="page-tag">💬 Section 4</div>
<div class="page-title">Communication Etiquette &amp; Feed Management</div>
<div class="page-desc">Communicate clearly, maintain proper ticket visibility, coordinate vendor meetings, and document handoffs.</div>
</div>
<div class="alert alert-red">
<div class="alert-title">🚨 Public Visibility Alert Warning</div>
    If <em>Make comments private</em> remains checked while an external contact is selected in <strong>Notify</strong>, a red warning banner ("Mark Public") will display. Click <strong>Mark Public</strong> to grant visibility before saving.
  </div>
<div class="grid-2">
<div class="card">
<div class="card-title"><span class="ico">👁</span> 6.1 — Public vs. Private Comment Rules</div>
<ul class="styled">
<li><strong>Messaging Requesters:</strong> Uncheck <em>Make comments private</em> to make comments visible to external requesters. Select the Requester in the Notify field.</li>
<li><strong>Internal Analyst Notes:</strong> Leave <em>Make comments private</em> checked to restrict notes to internal OIT users only.</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="card-title"><span class="ico">🔽</span> 6.2 — Feed Filtering &amp; Threaded Replies</div>
