<tr><td><span class="badge badge-amber">High</span></td><td>72 hours or less unavailable with severe University-wide disruption.</td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge badge-red">Critical</span></td><td>Control-system failure or compromise could create life-safety risk.</td></tr>
